[320.266972, "o", "**Implementation Plan: Raw Card Entry Form**\r\n\r\n**Task:** 实现原始卡录入表单 — create a raw (no third-party payment SDK) bank card entry form at route `/pay/card-form`.\r\n\r\n**Single file to create:** `packages/api/src/app/pay/card-form/page.tsx`\r\n\r\nIt follows the exact same pattern as the login page:\r\n- `'use client'` + `useState` for field values / errors / loading\r\n- Layout mirrors login: centered card on gradient background, `bg-surface-1 rounded-2xl`, `input-field`, `btn-primary` CSS classes\r\n\r\n**Four fields:**\r\n| Field | Notes |\r\n|---|---|\r\n| Cardholder name | `autoComplete=\"cc-name\"` |\r\n| Card number | Auto-formats to `XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX` |\r\n| Expiry (MM/YY) | Auto-inserts `/`, validates month + not past |\r\n| CVV | `type=\"password\"`, 3–4 digits |\r\n\r\nClient-side validation surfaces errors via the existing `<Alert intent=\"danger\">` component. Submit stubs a `fetch` to `/api/pay/charge` (no backend required for this deliverable).\r\n\r\nNo layout file needed — the page is standalone.\r\n"]
[320.26702, "o", "\r\n\u001b[34m→ Resuming session for interactive review…\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
[320.893074, "o", "\u001b7\u001b[r\u001b8\u001b[?25h"]
[321.140276, "o", "\u001b[?25l"]
[321.140437, "o", "\u001b[?2004h\u001b[?1004h\u001b[?2031h\u001b[<u\u001b[>1u\u001b[>4;2m"]
[321.140663, "o", "\u001b]0;✳ Claude Code\u0007"]
[321.191415, "o", "\u001b[38;5;174m ▐\u001b[48;5;16m▛███▜\u001b[49m▌\u001b[12G\u001b[39m\u001b[1mClaude\u001b[19GCode\u001b[24G\u001b[22m\u001b[38;5;246mv2.1.168\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[38;5;174m▝▜\u001b[48;5;16m█████\u001b[49m▛▘\u001b[12G\u001b[38;5;246mSonnet\u001b[19G4.6\u001b[23G(1M\u001b[27Gcontext)\u001b[36Gwith\u001b[41Ghigh\u001b[46Geffort\u001b[53G·\u001b[55GAPI\u001b[59GUsage\u001b[65GBilling\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[38;5;174m \u001b[3G▘▘\u001b[6G▝▝\u001b[12G\u001b[38;5;246m/…/nanyang2/PlanSync/.plansync-exec/cmqc4cfrm00d67qsg0zgrcx85\u001b[39m\r\r\n\r\r\n\u001b[48;5;237m\u001b[38;5;239m❯ \u001b[38;5;231mstart\u001b[39m                                                                         \u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[48;5;237m                                                                                \u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[48;5;237m  \u001b[38;5;231mPHASE 1 INSTRUCTION: After writing your implementation plan to the plan file,\u001b[39m \u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[48;5;237m  \u001b[38;5;231mSTOP. Do NOT proceed to implementation in this phase.\u001b[39m                         \u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[48;5;237m  \u001b[38;5;231mThe user will review and approve your plan in the next interactive phase.\u001b[39m     \u001b[49m\r\r\n\r\r\n\u001b[3G\u001b[38;5;246mThought\u001b[11Gfor\u001b[15G\u001b[1m3s\u001b[22m (ctrl+o\u001b[26Gto\u001b[29Gexpand)\u001b[39m\r\r\n\r\r\n\u001b[3G\u001b[38;5;246mThought\u001b[11Gfor\u001b[15G\u001b[1m8s\u001b[22m (ctrl+o\u001b[26Gto\u001b[29Gexpand)\u001b[39m\r\r\n\r\r\n\u001b[38;5;231m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mExec\u001b[8Gmode\u001b[13Gdetected.\u001b[23GLet\u001b[27Gme\u001b[30Gexplore\u001b[38Gthe\u001b[42Gcodebase\u001b[51Gbefore\u001b[58Gpresenting\u001b[69Gmy\u001b[72Gplan.\r\r\n\r\r\n\u001b[3G\u001b[38;5;246mThought\u001b[11Gfor\u001b[15G\u001b[1m17s\u001b[22m,\u001b[20Glisted\u001b[27G\u001b[1m4\u001b[22m directories\u001b[41G(ctrl+o\u001b[49Gto\u001b[52Gexpand)\u001b[39m\r\r\n\r\r\n\u001b[38;5;231m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mLet\u001b[7Gme\u001b[10Glook\u001b[15Gat\u001b[18Gexisting\u001b[27GUI\u001b[30Gcomponents\u001b[41Gand\u001b[45Gthe\u001b[49Glogin\u001b[55Gpage\u001b[60Gfor\u001b[64Greference\u001b[74Gon\r\r\n\u001b[3Gdesign\u001b[10Gpatterns.\r\r\n\r\r\n\u001b[3G\u001b[38;5;246mThought\u001b[11Gfor\u001b[15G\u001b[1m14s\u001b[22m,\u001b[20Gread\u001b[25G\u001b[1m3\u001b[22m files\u001b[33G(ctrl+o\u001b[41Gto\u001b[44Gexpand)\u001b[39m\r\r\n\r\r\n\u001b[38;5;231m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mNow\u001b[7GI\u001b[9Ghave\u001b[14Genough\u001b[21Gcontext.\u001b[30GLet\u001b[34Gme\u001b[37Genter\u001b[43Gplan\u001b[48Gmode\u001b[53Gand\u001b[57Gwrite\u001b[63Gmy\u001b[66Gimplementation\r\r\n\u001b[3Gplan.\r\r\n\r\r\n\u001b[38;5;109m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mEntered\u001b[11Gplan\u001b[16Gmode\r\r\n\u001b[3G\u001b[38;5;246mClaude\u001b[10Gis\u001b[13Gnow\u001b[17Gexploring\u001b[27Gand\u001b[31Gdesigning\u001b[41Gan\u001b[44Gimplementation\u001b[59Gapproach.\u001b[39m\r\r\n\r\r\n\u001b[3G\u001b[38;5;246mThought\u001b[11Gfor\u001b[15G\u001b[1m6s\u001b[22m (ctrl+o\u001b[26Gto\u001b[29Gexpand)\u001b[39m\r\r\n\r\r\n\u001b[38;5;75m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39m\u001b[1mUpdated\u001b[11Gplan\u001b[22m\r\r\n\u001b[38;5;246m \u001b[3G⎿\u001b[5G /plan\u001b[12Gto\u001b[15Gpreview\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[38;5;246m \u001b[3G⎿\u001b[5G \u001b[38;5;210mError:\u001b[13GExit\u001b[18Gplan\u001b[23Gmode?\u001b[39m\r\r\n\r\r\n\u001b[38;5;231m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39m\u001b[1mImplementation\u001b[18GPlan:\u001b[24GRaw\u001b[28GCard\u001b[33GEntry\u001b[39GForm\u001b[22m\r\r\n\r\r\n\u001b[3G\u001b[1mTask:\u001b[9G\u001b[22m实现原始卡录入表单\u001b[28G—\u001b[30Gcreate\u001b[37Ga\u001b[39Graw\u001b[43G(no\u001b[47Gthird-party\u001b[59Gpayment\u001b[67GSDK)\u001b[72Gbank\u001b[77Gcard\r\r\n\u001b[3Gentry\u001b[9Gform\u001b[14Gat\u001b[17Groute\u001b[23G\u001b[38;5;153m/pay/card-form\u001b[39m.\r\r\n\r\r\n\u001b[3G\u001b[1mSingle\u001b[10Gfile\u001b[15Gto\u001b[18Gcreate:\u001b[26G\u001b[22m\u001b[38;5;153mpackages/api/src/app/pay/card-form/page.tsx\u001b[39m\r\r\n