[326.038006, "o", "\u001b[2D\u001b[4B\r\u001b[7A\u001b[38;5;246m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mThinking for \u001b[1m4s\u001b[22m… \u001b[38;5;246m(ctrl+o\u001b[30G \u001b[32Gxpand)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;5;246m  ⎿  \u001b[39m\u001b[2m\u001b[3mThe user wants me to run an automated severity:must Issue fixer. This is a \r\u001b[1B\u001b[23m\u001b[22m     \u001b[2m\u001b[3mcomplex multi-step task. Let me start working through it systematically. \u001b[23m\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B   \u001b[6G\u001b[2m\u001b[3mLet me begin with the steps: Step 0: Ensure gh uses correct account Step 1:\r\u001b[1B\u001b[23m\u001b[22m     \u001b[2m\u001b[3mCheck working directory is clean Step 2: Sync master Step 3: Find up to 5 \u001b[23m\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B   \u001b[2m\u001b[3missues Then for each issue: steps 4-13 Let me start executing.\r\u001b[62C\u001b[1B\u001b[23m\u001b[22m\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[38;5;215m✽\u001b[3G\u001b[38;5;222mH\u001b[38;5;215myperspacing…\u001b[17G\u001b[38;5;246m(4s\u001b[21G·\u001b[23G↓\u001b[25G96\u001b[28Gtokens\u001b[35G·\u001b[37Gthought\u001b[45Gfor\u001b[49G2s)\u001b[39m\r\r\n\r\r\n\u001b[38;5;244m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[38;5;246m❯ \u001b[39m\u001b[7m \u001b[27m\r\r\n\u001b[38;5;244m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[3G\u001b[38;5;210m⏵⏵\u001b[6Gbypass\u001b[13Gpermissions\u001b[25Gon\u001b[38;5;246m (shift+tab\u001b[39Gto\u001b[42Gcycle)\u001b[49G·\u001b[51Gesc\u001b[55Gto\u001b[58Ginterrupt\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[63G\u001b[38;5;246m●\u001b[65Ghigh\u001b[70G·\u001b[72G/effort\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[2C\u001b[4A"]
